consulted; reviews and histories are unused directly.

`run_full_diagnosis(train_loader)` runs two probes. Batches contain `(None, 
sequence, positive, negative)`, with tensors shaped B × L. The margin probe 
switches to evaluation mode, computes sequence features, stacks 
positive/negative IDs into B × L × 2, and calls `predict_score`. Both probes 
disable gradients.

# Probes & Metrics

- **`embedding_collapse_score`**: Samples up to 2,048 nonpadding item embeddings
with seed 42, normalizes them, averages off-diagonal cosine similarities, and 
maps the result to [0,1]. Higher values indicate stronger directional alignment.
Approximately 0.5 means near-zero average cosine; this alone does not establish 
