Reflection 1: current report is not sufficient because ['The residual has an 
unexamined ranking property: without clipping, log(p(j|i)/q_j) = 
log(1+c_ij/(alpha*q_j)) − log(1+n_i/alpha). With candidate-independent anchor 
weights, the second term cancels in candidate rankings. Row support therefore 
does not independently attenuate ranking changes; clipping can change this 
behavior. Include an explicit support-weighting ablation.', "Cross-fitting is 
